PART 17: DEPENDENCY ARRAY COMPARISON TABLE
================================================================================

+-----------------------+--------------------------------+-----------------------+
| DEPENDENCY ARRAY      | EFFECT BEHAVIOR                | EXAMPLE USE           |
+-----------------------+--------------------------------+-----------------------+
| omitted               | After every relevant render    | Special sync cases    |
| []                    | No changing reactive deps      | Initial connection    |
| [searchTerm]          | searchTerm changes             | Search                |
| [userId]              | userId changes                 | Load user             |
| [category, sortBy]    | Either value changes           | Filtering             |
| [intervalMs]          | Interval changes               | Timer setup           |
+-----------------------+--------------------------------+-----------------------+


