+-------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| CONCEPT                 | MEANING                                    |
+-------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| Dependency Array        | Reactive values used by Effect             |
| []                      | No changing reactive dependencies          |
| [x]                     | Effect responds when x changes             |
| [x, y]                  | Effect responds when x or y changes        |
| Cleanup                 | Stop previous Effect synchronization       |
| Functional State Update | Update from previous state                 |
| Debounce                | Wait for user to pause                     |
| clearTimeout            | Cancel pending debounce callback           |
| clearInterval           | Stop repeating timer                       |
| AbortController         | Cancel obsolete fetch                      |
| encodeURIComponent      | Safely encode query input                  |
+-------------------------+--------------------------------------------+


