================================================================================
MOST IMPORTANT RULE
================================================================================

THE DEPENDENCY ARRAY SHOULD DESCRIBE
THE REACTIVE VALUES USED BY THE EFFECT.

DO NOT:

ADD OR REMOVE DEPENDENCIES JUST TO FORCE
A PARTICULAR NUMBER OF EFFECT EXECUTIONS.


Instead understand:

WHAT EXTERNAL SYSTEM IS THIS EFFECT SYNCHRONIZING?

AND:

WHICH REACTIVE VALUES CONTROL THAT SYNCHRONIZATION?


