================================================================================
KEY TAKEAWAY
================================================================================

The dependency array connects:

REACTIVE VALUES

to:

EXTERNAL SYNCHRONIZATION


Example:

intervalMs
     ↓
Timer Setup


searchTerm
     ↓
Backend Search


userId
     ↓
User API Request


When a dependency changes:

RENDER
 ↓
COMMIT
 ↓
CLEAN UP PREVIOUS EFFECT
 ↓
SET UP EFFECT WITH CURRENT VALUES


The goal is not:

"Make the Effect run as little as possible."


The goal is:

"Make the Effect synchronize correctly
with the values it actually depends on."


